  >>> image = np.array([[[1], [2]], [[3], [4]]])
  >>> tf.image.random_flip_up_down(image, 3).numpy().tolist()
  [[[3], [4]], [[1], [2]]]

  Randomly flip multiple images.

  >>> images = np.array(
  ... [
  ...     [[[1], [2]], [[3], [4]]],
  ...     [[[5], [6]], [[7], [8]]]
